  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkey: Resilience Innovation Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to empowering refugee, migrant and host community youth in Gaziantep through services provided by the Resilience Innovation Centre (RIF) towards invention, innovation, learning and livelihood creation. Based on a multi-stakeholder approach, the RIF will be jointly managed by IOM and the Gaziantep University (GU). The RIF will be made accesible to all target groups above, fully equipped with digital and computer-assisted equipment and complemented by targeted trainings and mentorship programmes on innovation, creative design, etc. for selected youth beneficiaries, who will be empowered to develop innovative projects and business ideas.</narrative>
  </description>
